<!--
  ExpoShare sitemap.

  Only static pages are listed here. Individual presentations
  (presentation.html?id=...) and public profiles
  (public-profile.html?username=...) are dynamic content stored in
  Supabase, not files in this repo, so a static sitemap can't
  enumerate them the way it can for a build-time site. If that
  matters to you later, the usual fix is a small script or Supabase
  Edge Function that queries approved presentations/profiles and
  regenerates this file (or serves an XML response directly) on a
  schedule. Not required for the site to work or be crawlable, just
  something to know is out of scope for a plain static file.

  admin.html, profile.html, update-password.html, and
  forgot-password.html are intentionally excluded here to match
  robots.txt, since they're private/utility pages with no reason to
  appear in search results.
-->
